    "sentence_translations": [
      "(6) You Are Very Kind",
      "",
      "Little Dong and Old Guan were talking on the phone.",
      "",
      "Old Guan asked, “Are you home alone?”",
      "",
      "Little Dong said, “Yes. Old Guan, Old Guan, today I saw a cat at school, a very beautiful cat.",
      "I really like it! What about you? Do you like cats?",
      "",
      "Old Guan thought about it and said, “Not really.”",
      "",
      "Little Dong said, “Tell me, what do cats like to eat?",
      "I want to give the cat something to eat, but I don’t know what cats like to eat. Apples? Do cats eat apples?”",
      "",
      "Old Guan said, “Cats eat rice. Cats also eat vegetables.”",
      "",
      "Little Dong said, “Really? Do you have a cat? What about a dog? Do you have a dog?”",
      "",
      "Old Guan said, “I don’t have a cat, nor do I have a dog, but I think they eat rice and vegetables.”",
      "",
      "Little Dong said, “Okay, I will give them rice and vegetables tomorrow. Thank you, Old Guan, you are very kind!”",
      "",
      "Old Guan was very happy that Little Dong said: “ni zhen hao” [you are very kind].",
      "These three characters were so good to hear!"
    ]
  }
